{"module":"grammar","item":{"id":"a2-grammar-praepositionen-akkusativ","level":"A2","topic":"Präpositionen","title":{"de":"für, ohne, durch, gegen, um","bn":"Akkusativ নেয় এমন Prepositions"},"summary":"für, ohne, durch, gegen, um-এর পরে সব সময় Akkusativ: für meinen Vater।","intro":[{"kind":"text","text":"কিছু preposition-এর পরে সব সময় Akkusativ আসে। মাত্র পাঁচটি, তাই মুখস্থ করা সহজ: für, ohne, durch, gegen, um।"}],"sections":[{"heading":"১. পাঁচটি preposition","blocks":[{"kind":"table","rows":[["Preposition","বাংলা অর্থ","উদাহরণ"],["für","জন্য","für den Kurs"],["ohne","ছাড়া","ohne den Schlüssel"],["durch","ভেতর দিয়ে","durch den Park"],["gegen","বিরুদ্ধে / প্রায় (সময়)","gegen den Wind"],["um","চারপাশে / ঠিক সময়ে","um den See, um 8 Uhr"]]},{"kind":"text","text":"Akkusativ-এ শুধু masculine শব্দ বদলায়: der → den, ein → einen, mein → meinen। die আর das একই থাকে।"}]},{"heading":"২. উদাহরণ","blocks":[{"kind":"examples","items":[{"de":"Das Geschenk ist für meinen Vater.","bn":"উপহারটি আমার বাবার জন্য।"}]},{"kind":"list","items":["Das Geschenk = উপহারটি","für = জন্য","meinen Vater = আমার বাবা (Akkusativ)"]},{"kind":"text","text":"খেয়াল করো: mein Vater হয়েছে meinen Vater, কারণ für-এর পরে Akkusativ।"},{"kind":"list","items":["ভুল: für mein Vater","সঠিক: für meinen Vater"]},{"kind":"text","text":"আরও উদাহরণ:"},{"kind":"examples","items":[{"de":"Ich trinke Kaffee ohne Zucker.","bn":"আমি চিনি ছাড়া কফি খাই।"},{"de":"Wir gehen durch den Park.","bn":"আমরা পার্কের ভেতর দিয়ে যাই।"},{"de":"Bayern spielt heute gegen Dortmund.","bn":"আজ বায়ার্ন ডর্টমুন্ডের বিরুদ্ধে খেলছে।"},{"de":"Ich komme gegen acht Uhr.","bn":"আমি আটটার দিকে আসব।"},{"de":"Wir fahren um den See.","bn":"আমরা লেকের চারপাশ দিয়ে ঘুরে যাই।"}]}]}],"test":[{"id":"a2-grammar-praepositionen-akkusativ-t1","type":"mcq","prompt":"Das Geschenk ist für ___ Vater.","options":["mein","meinen","meinem"],"answer":1,"explanation":"für + Akkusativ: meinen Vater।"},{"id":"a2-grammar-praepositionen-akkusativ-t2","type":"mcq","prompt":"„ohne“ মানে কী?","options":["সঙ্গে","ছাড়া","জন্য"],"answer":1,"explanation":"ohne = ছাড়া।"},{"id":"a2-grammar-praepositionen-akkusativ-t3","type":"mcq","prompt":"Wir gehen durch ___ Park.","options":["den","dem","der"],"answer":0,"explanation":"durch + Akkusativ: den Park।"},{"id":"a2-grammar-praepositionen-akkusativ-t4","type":"mcq","prompt":"কোনটির পরে সব সময় Akkusativ?","options":["mit","für","bei"],"answer":1,"explanation":"für, ohne, durch, gegen, um → Akkusativ। mit ও bei → Dativ।"},{"id":"a2-grammar-praepositionen-akkusativ-t5","type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich komme ___ acht Uhr. (আটটার দিকে)","options":["gegen","durch","ohne"],"answer":0,"explanation":"সময়ের সঙ্গে gegen = প্রায় / দিকে।"},{"id":"a2-grammar-praepositionen-akkusativ-t6","type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich trinke Kaffee ___ Zucker. (চিনি ছাড়া)","options":["für","ohne","um"],"answer":1,"explanation":"ohne = ছাড়া।"}]},"schema":1,"id":"a2-grammar-praepositionen-akkusativ","level":"A2","test":[{"id":"a2-grammar-praepositionen-akkusativ-t1","type":"mcq","prompt":"Das Geschenk ist für ___ Vater.","options":["mein","meinen","meinem"],"answer":1,"explanation":"für + Akkusativ: meinen Vater।"},{"id":"a2-grammar-praepositionen-akkusativ-t2","type":"mcq","prompt":"„ohne“ মানে কী?","options":["সঙ্গে","ছাড়া","জন্য"],"answer":1,"explanation":"ohne = ছাড়া।"},{"id":"a2-grammar-praepositionen-akkusativ-t3","type":"mcq","prompt":"Wir gehen durch ___ Park.","options":["den","dem","der"],"answer":0,"explanation":"durch + Akkusativ: den Park।"},{"id":"a2-grammar-praepositionen-akkusativ-t4","type":"mcq","prompt":"কোনটির পরে সব সময় Akkusativ?","options":["mit","für","bei"],"answer":1,"explanation":"für, ohne, durch, gegen, um → Akkusativ। mit ও bei → Dativ।"},{"id":"a2-grammar-praepositionen-akkusativ-t5","type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich komme ___ acht Uhr. (আটটার দিকে)","options":["gegen","durch","ohne"],"answer":0,"explanation":"সময়ের সঙ্গে gegen = প্রায় / দিকে।"},{"id":"a2-grammar-praepositionen-akkusativ-t6","type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich trinke Kaffee ___ Zucker. (চিনি ছাড়া)","options":["für","ohne","um"],"answer":1,"explanation":"ohne = ছাড়া।"}]}